sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client
    participant Supabase as Supabase Auth
    participant API as FastAPI API
    participant JWT as JWT Verifier
    participant RateLimit as Rate Limiter
    participant Route as Route Handler
    participant DB as Database

    Client->>Supabase: 1. User logs in
    Supabase-->>Client: 2. Return JWT token

    Client->>API: 3. API Request<br/>Authorization: Bearer <token>
    API->>JWT: 4. Extract token
    JWT->>JWT: 5. Decode token
    JWT->>JWT: 6. Verify signature
    JWT->>JWT: 7. Check expiration
    JWT-->>API: 8. Extract user_id, email

    API->>JWT: 9. get_user_role(email)
    JWT->>JWT: 10. Check ADMIN_EMAILS whitelist
    JWT-->>API: 11. Return user_role

    API->>RateLimit: 12. check_rate_limit(user_id, user_role)
    RateLimit->>RateLimit: 13. Admin? → unlimited
    RateLimit->>RateLimit: 14. Regular? → check Redis
    RateLimit-->>API: 15. allowed=true/false

    alt Rate limit exceeded
        API-->>Client: 16. 429 Too Many Requests
    else Rate limit OK
        API->>Route: 17. Execute route handler
        Route->>DB: 18. Query with user_id filter
        DB-->>Route: 19. Return data
        Route-->>API: 20. Return response
        API-->>Client: 21. 200 OK with data
    end
